    narr:narration """This hub is the voice of a session-chronicler whose register runs editorial: most entries are [quote frames and lead-ins](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_3) that carry another speaker's rulings rather than the speaker's own stances — several children are [signed by the quoted principal](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_29), and the [context-dependent framing judgment](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_22) is relayed, not owned. Where the voice is its own, it decides and files: [a task filed under the read-path epic](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_24), [an export ban until design is tested](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_2), and a [ruled division of labor between steering and engine recall](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_51). It also measures: [frame-index recall numbers against production's placements](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_43), and [a concession about the hand-rolled read layer](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_48). The antithesis-plus-parallelism style shows in [what a mature engine adds and does not](narr:Expr_20261014_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2b4e6ba9fb14_49).""" ;
